<section id="s1"><div class="num">01</div><h2>Agreement to these Terms</h2><p>These Terms of Use (&ldquo;Terms&rdquo;) are the rules for using Stratic Market (&ldquo;Stratic Market&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;), including our app, website and shop pages (together, the &ldquo;Service&rdquo;). By creating an account, listing a product, placing an order, sending a message, or otherwise using the Service, you agree to these Terms and to our <a class="dl" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree, please do not use the Service.</p><p>You can read how the Service works, step by step, in the Privacy Policy&rsquo;s walk-through section. These Terms explain the rules and responsibilities that apply while you use it.</p></section>
<section id="s2"><div class="num">02</div><h2>What Stratic Market is</h2><p>Stratic Market is an online marketplace that lets people list products, find products, chat, and place orders. We provide the platform. <b>The sale itself is between the buyer and the seller.</b> Stratic Market does not own, inspect, store, pack or ship the products listed by sellers, and is not the seller of those products unless we say so clearly on the listing.</p><p>Because of this, sellers are responsible for what they list and deliver, and buyers are responsible for the choices they make when buying. We try to keep the Service safe and honest, but we cannot guarantee any listing, seller, buyer or transaction.</p></section>
<section id="s3"><div class="num">03</div><h2>Your account</h2><p>You must give correct information when you sign up and keep it up to date. You are responsible for everything done through your account, so keep your password private and never share OTPs. Tell us through <a class="dl" href="/shop#go-help">Help</a> straight away if you think someone else used your account.</p><p>You must be able to form a binding contract under the law that applies to you. One person should use one account for their own activity. We may refuse, suspend or close accounts that break these Terms or put others at risk.</p></section>
<section id="s4"><div class="num">04</div><h2>Rules for sellers</h2><p><b>Listings must be true.</b> Photos, names, prices, descriptions, quantities and details must match the product you actually sell. Do not use misleading prices, fake discounts, stolen photos or false claims.</p><p><b>No expired products.</b> You must never list a product whose expiry date has passed. Expired items are rejected. Repeating this can lead to removal of listings, suspension or closure of your account, and, where the law requires, legal action. If your product has an expiry date, enter the correct date when you <a class="dl" href="/shop#go-sell">list it</a>.</p><p><b>Prohibited items.</b> Do not list anything that is illegal to sell, counterfeit, stolen, unsafe, harmful to health, or that you have no right to sell. This includes weapons, illegal drugs, items that infringe someone&rsquo;s rights, and anything the law of your place or the buyer&rsquo;s place forbids. We may remove any listing at our discretion.</p><p><b>Your payment QR.</b> Upload only a real payment QR that belongs to you. Do not upload someone else&rsquo;s QR, a fake QR, or any picture that is not a payment QR. Do not use the Service to collect money and then fail to deliver.</p><p><b>Delivery.</b> You must deliver the product you sold, safely and on time, to the address the buyer gave. At present you deliver the product yourself and bear the delivery cost. After Stratic Market has been installed on your phone for six months, Stratic Market will bear the delivery cost. We may change this arrangement in future, and we will show any change in the app or in our Privacy Policy before it applies.</p><p><b>Taxes and licences.</b> You are responsible for any licences, tax registrations and tax payments that apply to your sales, including GST where it applies. Enter your tax details correctly if you choose to provide them.</p><p><b>Confirming payments.</b> For orders paid by your own QR, an order is confirmed only after the payment has really reached you. Confirm an order only when the full amount has arrived in your account. Do not confirm an order for money you have not received, and do not ship until you are satisfied the payment is real.</p></section>
<section id="s5"><div class="num">05</div><h2>Rules for buyers</h2><p>Give a correct name, phone number and delivery address. Pay the full price shown for the product. Do not place orders you do not intend to pay for or accept, and do not enter a false Transaction ID or claim a payment you did not make. Doing so is fraud and can lead to account closure and legal action.</p><p>Read the listing before you buy. If a listing is unclear, ask the seller in <a class="dl" href="/shop#go-chat">Chat</a> first.</p></section>
<section id="s6"><div class="num">06</div><h2>Payments</h2><p><b>Cash on Delivery.</b> You pay the seller in cash when the product arrives.</p><p><b>Seller&rsquo;s QR.</b> You pay the seller directly through your own payment app. Stratic Market does not receive, hold or transfer this money, and cannot see your bank. Because of this, the order stays unconfirmed until the seller confirms that the full amount has reached them. If the amount that reached the seller is lower than the order total, the order is not confirmed.</p><p><b>Gateway payment.</b> Some sellers connect their own payment gateway. Your payment is handled by the gateway, not by us. The order is confirmed only after our server verifies the payment with the gateway and the amount is at least the order total. We never see or store your card details.</p><p><b>Refunds and disputes.</b> Unless a listing says otherwise, refunds and returns are agreed between the buyer and the seller. If a payment was taken and the order was not confirmed, contact us through <a class="dl" href="/shop#go-help">Help</a> with your order number. We will try to help, but we cannot promise to recover money that was paid directly to a seller.</p><p><b>Fees.</b> Stratic Market currently charges no commission on sales. A payment gateway may charge the seller its own fees. If we introduce fees later, we will announce them in the app before they apply.</p></section>
<section id="s7"><div class="num">07</div><h2>Orders, cancellation and delivery</h2><p>An order is a request to buy that becomes a sale when it is confirmed as described above. A buyer can cancel an order within 24 hours of placing it, from <a class="dl" href="/shop#go-orders">My orders</a>, by giving a reason. After that, cancellation depends on the seller. A seller can also cancel an order, for example when a product is out of stock, and should then refund any money already paid.</p><p>Delivery times shown in the app are estimates, not promises. Delivery is carried out by the seller. Delay, damage or loss in delivery is between the buyer and the seller, but please tell us if you cannot resolve it.</p></section>
<section id="s8"><div class="num">08</div><h2>Chat and behaviour</h2><p>Use <a class="dl" href="/shop#go-chat">Chat</a> politely. Do not harass, threaten, insult or discriminate against anyone. Do not send sexual, violent, hateful or illegal content. Do not ask others for OTPs, passwords or card details, and do not try to move a buyer to an unsafe payment method. Do not send spam or scams.</p><p>You can block and report people from the chat menu. We may review reported conversations and may take action, including removing content or closing accounts.</p></section>
<section id="s9"><div class="num">09</div><h2>Your content</h2><p>You keep ownership of the photos, text and other content you upload. By uploading it you give Stratic Market a non-exclusive, worldwide, free licence to store, show and process it as needed to run the Service, for example to display your product to buyers and your messages to the person you are chatting with. This licence ends when you delete the content or your account, except where we must keep copies for legal reasons or for content others have already received.</p><p>You promise that you have the right to upload your content and that it does not break anyone&rsquo;s rights or the law. If you think content on the Service breaks your rights, tell us through <a class="dl" href="/shop#go-help">Help</a> with the details and we will look into it.</p></section>
<section id="s10"><div class="num">10</div><h2>Things you must not do</h2><p>Do not break or try to break the security of the Service; do not access accounts or data that are not yours; do not use bots or automated tools to scrape, spam or overload the Service; do not copy, sell or reverse-engineer the Service except as the law allows; do not pretend to be another person or business; do not use the Service for anything unlawful.</p></section>
<section id="s11"><div class="num">11</div><h2>Our rights</h2><p>We may change, pause or stop any part of the Service, remove content that breaks these Terms, and suspend or close accounts, with or without notice where needed to protect users or the Service. We may refuse to confirm or may cancel an order that appears fraudulent. If we close your account, you may lose access to your listings, orders and chats.</p><p>The Stratic Market name, logo, design and software belong to us or our licensors. These Terms do not give you any right to use them except to use the Service normally.</p></section>
<section id="s12"><div class="num">12</div><h2>No promises about the Service</h2><p>We work to keep the Service running and accurate, but it is provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as available&rdquo;. We do not promise that it will always be available, error-free or secure, that listings are accurate, or that any buyer or seller will behave honestly. You use the Service at your own risk and should take sensible care in every transaction, including checking a payment before shipping and checking a product before paying.</p></section>
<section id="s13"><div class="num">13</div><h2>Limit of our responsibility</h2><p>To the extent the law allows, Stratic Market is not responsible for the products sold, for what buyers and sellers do or fail to do, for payments made directly between buyers and sellers, for delivery problems, or for indirect or consequential losses such as lost profit or lost data. Where the law does not allow us to exclude responsibility, our total responsibility to you for any claim is limited to the amount of fees, if any, you paid to us for the Service in the three months before the claim. Nothing in these Terms limits any right you have under consumer law that cannot be limited.</p></section>
<section id="s14"><div class="num">14</div><h2>If you break these Terms</h2><p>You agree to compensate Stratic Market for losses and claims that arise from your content, your products, or your breach of these Terms or the law, to the extent the law allows. We may also report serious misuse, such as fraud, to the authorities.</p></section>
<section id="s15"><div class="num">15</div><h2>Closing your account</h2><p>You can stop using the Service at any time and can ask us to close your account through <a class="dl" href="/shop#go-help">Help</a>. Orders already placed and money already paid remain between the buyer and the seller. Parts of these Terms that by their nature should continue, such as those about content licence, responsibility and disputes, continue after your account is closed.</p></section>
<section id="s16"><div class="num">16</div><h2>Changes to these Terms</h2><p>We may update these Terms. The new version will appear on this page with a new effective date, and for important changes we will also tell you in the app. If you keep using the Service after a change, you accept the updated Terms.</p></section>
<section id="s17"><div class="num">17</div><h2>Law and disputes</h2><p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Please try first to settle any problem with us through <a class="dl" href="/shop#go-help">Help</a>. If it cannot be settled, the courts at the place of Stratic Market&rsquo;s principal place of business will have jurisdiction, unless the law gives you the right to go to another court.</p></section>
<section id="s18"><div class="num">18</div><h2>Contact us</h2><p>For questions about these Terms, open <a class="dl" href="/shop#go-help">Help</a> in the app or ask the <a class="dl" href="/shop#go-ai">AI Assistant</a>, and include your account email and, if it is about an order, the order number.</p></section>
